id: pm-ikgitf
title: Honor DO_NOT_TRACK across telemetry capture flush and diagnostics
description: "GitHub report https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1245. Truthy DO_NOT_TRACK disables capture flush OTLP and consent prompts; health reports the effective override; temporary-project regression proves no network delivery."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags: []
created_at: "2026-09-12T21:08:30.124Z"
updated_at: "2026-09-12T22:41:43.531Z"
