completed_at: "2026-09-12T22:24:24.651Z"
author: "harness:codex"
acceptance_criteria: Truthy DO_NOT_TRACK disables capture flush OTLP and consent prompts; health reports the effective override; temporary-project regression proves no network delivery.
goal: project management = context management
objective: Honor DO_NOT_TRACK across telemetry capture flush and diagnostics
value: Reliable privacy-preserving operational context for agents and package consumers
parent: pm-5oj5
resolution: Shared process consent honors DO_NOT_TRACK across capture flush OTLP Sentry startup prompts and probes. SDK status distinguishes saved and effective consent. Intentional-delivery fixtures isolate inherited host DO_NOT_TRACK and restore it afterward.
expected_result: Production opts out before identity or delivery; deliberate test fixtures remain portable across host consent settings.
actual_result: 8789 tests pass with exact 100/100/100/100 coverage. All 156 affected tests pass under DO_NOT_TRACK=1 after the pre-fix run failed 16 cases. Static and graph gates pass.
